{"title": "Bracing Band", "pageid": 3614, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Bracing_Band", "categories": ["Rings", "Uncommon items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"> \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-uncommon\"><figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Ring_E_Silver_A_1_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b1/Ring_E_Silver_A_1_Faded.png/300px-Ring_E_Silver_A_1_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/b/b1/Ring_E_Silver_A_1_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Bracing Band image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b1/Ring_E_Silver_A_1_Faded.png/300px-Ring_E_Silver_A_1_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b1/Ring_E_Silver_A_1_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p>The <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span style=\"color: #01BD39 ;\">Bracing Band</span></a> is an uncommon <a href=\"/wiki/Rings\" title=\"Rings\">Ring</a> which makes the wearer more difficult to hit after they shove an enemy.\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>A common ring, simple and unadorned. Though there is a certain heft to it...\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\" style=\"margin-left: 7px\"> \n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Rings\" title=\"Rings\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c4/Rings_Icon.png/25px-Rings_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c4/Rings_Icon.png/38px-Rings_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c4/Rings_Icon.png/50px-Rings_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Rings\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c4/Rings_Icon.png/25px-Rings_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c4/Rings_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Rings\" title=\"Rings\">Rings</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/38px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Rarity: Uncommon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png/25px-Rarity_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Rarity_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Rarity: <span style=\"color: #01BD39 ;\">Uncommon</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/38px-Weight_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Weight: 0.05 kg (0.1 lb)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png/25px-Weight_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ea/Weight_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Weight: 0.05 kg (0.1 lb)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Price: 40 gp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Gold_Icon.png/25px-Gold_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Gold_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Price:  40  gp</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_Shove_ACboost_Ring</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Shove_ACboost_Ring\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Shove_ACboost_Ring\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">c714fc94-eeaf-4622-9375-545261867514</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:c714fc94-eeaf-4622-9375-545261867514\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:c714fc94-eeaf-4622-9375-545261867514\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>Stats</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">MAG_Shove_ACboost_Ring</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Shove_ACboost_Ring+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:MAG_Shove_ACboost_Ring+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special\">Special</span></h3>\n<p>The wearer of this item gains:\n\n</p>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Space\" title=\"Personal Space\">Personal Space</a></dt><dd>After shoving an enemy<sup class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\"><i>[<a href=\"/wiki/Personal_Space#Notes\" title=\"Personal Space\">See Notes</a>]</i></sup>, the wearer gains a +1 to their <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/38px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Armour Class\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\">Armour Class</a> until their next turn.</dd></dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Grymforge\" title=\"Grymforge\">Grymforge</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;-628&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;320</span>: Rewarded by <a href=\"/wiki/Elenna_Thrinn\" title=\"Elenna Thrinn\">Sergeant Thrinn</a> after returning her boots in the quest <a href=\"/wiki/Find_the_Missing_Boots\" title=\"Find the Missing Boots\">Find the Missing Boots</a></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This is one of two possible rewards for <a href=\"/wiki/Find_the_Missing_Boots\" title=\"Find the Missing Boots\">Find the Missing Boots</a>, the other being <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_of_Uninhibited_Kushigo\" title=\"Armour of Uninhibited Kushigo\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e1/Armour_of_Uninhibited_Kushigo_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Armour_of_Uninhibited_Kushigo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e1/Armour_of_Uninhibited_Kushigo_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Armour_of_Uninhibited_Kushigo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e1/Armour_of_Uninhibited_Kushigo_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Armour_of_Uninhibited_Kushigo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e1/Armour_of_Uninhibited_Kushigo_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Armour_of_Uninhibited_Kushigo_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e1/Armour_of_Uninhibited_Kushigo_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_of_Uninhibited_Kushigo\" title=\"Armour of Uninhibited Kushigo\">Armour of Uninhibited Kushigo</a>.</li></ul>\n\n<p><i>Regarding Personal Space:</i></p>\n<ul><li>The effect is capped at 1 stack; pushing more than one enemy during the same turn does not grant additional benefits.</li>\n<li>The effect triggers when pushing an enemy in any manner, not just with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shove\" title=\"Shove\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6b/Shove_Icon.webp/20px-Shove_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6b/Shove_Icon.webp/30px-Shove_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6b/Shove_Icon.webp/40px-Shove_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shove\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6b/Shove_Icon.webp/20px-Shove_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6b/Shove_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shove\" title=\"Shove\">Shove</a>. For example, hitting an enemy with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Repelling_Blast\" title=\"Repelling Blast\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/65/Repelling_Blast_Icon.webp/20px-Repelling_Blast_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/65/Repelling_Blast_Icon.webp/30px-Repelling_Blast_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/65/Repelling_Blast_Icon.webp/40px-Repelling_Blast_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Repelling Blast\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/65/Repelling_Blast_Icon.webp/20px-Repelling_Blast_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/65/Repelling_Blast_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Repelling_Blast\" title=\"Repelling Blast\">Repelling Blast</a> also provides the +1 AC. This effect is also triggered by:\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thorn_Whip\" title=\"Thorn Whip\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e8/Thorn_Whip_Icon.webp/25px-Thorn_Whip_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e8/Thorn_Whip_Icon.webp/38px-Thorn_Whip_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e8/Thorn_Whip_Icon.webp/50px-Thorn_Whip_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Thorn Whip\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e8/Thorn_Whip_Icon.webp/25px-Thorn_Whip_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e8/Thorn_Whip_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Thorn_Whip\" title=\"Thorn Whip\">Thorn Whip</a> (and the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sorrowful_Lash\" title=\"Sorrowful Lash\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e8/Thorn_Whip_Icon.webp/25px-Thorn_Whip_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/e8/Thorn_Whip_Icon.webp/38px-Thorn_Whip_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/e8/Thorn_Whip_Icon.webp/50px-Thorn_Whip_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Sorrowful Lash\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e8/Thorn_Whip_Icon.webp/25px-Thorn_Whip_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/e8/Thorn_Whip_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Sorrowful_Lash\" title=\"Sorrowful Lash\">Sorrowful Lash</a> variety)</li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mobile_Flourish_(Ranged)\" title=\"Mobile Flourish (Ranged)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Mobile_Flourish_Ranged_Icon.webp/25px-Mobile_Flourish_Ranged_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Mobile_Flourish_Ranged_Icon.webp/38px-Mobile_Flourish_Ranged_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Mobile_Flourish_Ranged_Icon.webp/50px-Mobile_Flourish_Ranged_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mobile Flourish (Ranged)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Mobile_Flourish_Ranged_Icon.webp/25px-Mobile_Flourish_Ranged_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d6/Mobile_Flourish_Ranged_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mobile_Flourish_(Ranged)\" title=\"Mobile Flourish (Ranged)\">Mobile Flourish (Ranged)</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mobile_Flourish_(Melee)\" title=\"Mobile Flourish (Melee)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Mobile_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp/25px-Mobile_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bf/Mobile_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp/38px-Mobile_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bf/Mobile_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp/50px-Mobile_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mobile Flourish (Melee)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bf/Mobile_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp/25px-Mobile_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bf/Mobile_Flourish_Melee_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Mobile_Flourish_(Melee)\" title=\"Mobile Flourish (Melee)\">Mobile Flourish (Melee)</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Flurry_of_Blows:_Push\" title=\"Flurry of Blows: Push\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0e/Flurry_of_Blows_Push_Icon.webp/25px-Flurry_of_Blows_Push_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0e/Flurry_of_Blows_Push_Icon.webp/38px-Flurry_of_Blows_Push_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0e/Flurry_of_Blows_Push_Icon.webp/50px-Flurry_of_Blows_Push_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Flurry of Blows: Push\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0e/Flurry_of_Blows_Push_Icon.webp/25px-Flurry_of_Blows_Push_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0e/Flurry_of_Blows_Push_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Flurry_of_Blows:_Push\" title=\"Flurry of Blows: Push\">Flurry of Blows: Push</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bull_Rush\" title=\"Bull Rush\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/44/Charge_Minotaur_Icon.webp/25px-Charge_Minotaur_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/44/Charge_Minotaur_Icon.webp/38px-Charge_Minotaur_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/44/Charge_Minotaur_Icon.webp/50px-Charge_Minotaur_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bull Rush\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/44/Charge_Minotaur_Icon.webp/25px-Charge_Minotaur_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/44/Charge_Minotaur_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bull_Rush\" title=\"Bull Rush\">Bull Rush</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Arrow_of_Roaring_Thunder\" title=\"Arrow of Roaring Thunder\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bd/Arrow_of_Roaring_Thunder_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Arrow_of_Roaring_Thunder_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bd/Arrow_of_Roaring_Thunder_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Arrow_of_Roaring_Thunder_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bd/Arrow_of_Roaring_Thunder_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Arrow_of_Roaring_Thunder_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bd/Arrow_of_Roaring_Thunder_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Arrow_of_Roaring_Thunder_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bd/Arrow_of_Roaring_Thunder_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Arrow_of_Roaring_Thunder\" title=\"Arrow of Roaring Thunder\">Arrow of Roaring Thunder</a></li>\n<li>And any other action that <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Actions_that_push_or_pull\" title=\"Category:Actions that push or pull\">pushes or pulls</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195612\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.084 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.089 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2026/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 50282/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 10573/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.0